meta {
  name: Set notification preferences
  type: http
  seq: 27
}

put {
  url: {{api}}/bonds/{{bondId}}/members/me/notifications
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "categories": {
      "onThisDay": true
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Turns the kinds of push you send on or off, and leaves the ones you do not send as they are: this body turns on-this-day on and changes nothing else. `categories` is required (422 without it); a value that is not true or false is 400. Quiet hours and the reminder time are on the member settings, not here, and that PUT does not touch these.

  After the bond has ended it is 409 BOND_ARCHIVED. Turning a kind off holds back your own copy only: your partner is still told, and is not told that you are not (ADR-0045).
}
